<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<packagedElement xmlns:uml="http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001"
                  xmlns:xmi="http://www.omg.org/spec/XMI/20131001"
                  xmi:id="skos.Concept"
                  xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept"
                  xmi:type="uml:Class">
   <ownedComment xmi:id="skos.Concept-ownedComment"
                  xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-ownedComment"
                  xmi:type="uml:Comment">
      <body>Definition
==========
The class skos:Concept is the class of SKOS concepts.

A SKOS concept can be viewed as an idea or notion; a unit of thought. However, what constitutes a unit of thought is subjective, and this definition is meant to be suggestive, rather than restrictive.

The notion of a SKOS concept is useful when describing the conceptual or intellectual structure of a knowledge organization system, and when referring to specific ideas or meanings established within a KOS.

Note that, because SKOS is designed to be a vehicle for representing semi-formal KOS, such as thesauri and classification schemes, a certain amount of flexibility has been built in to the formal definition of this class.

See the SKOS primer [https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-primer/] for more examples of identifying and describing SKOS concepts.
</body>
      <annotatedElement xmi:idref="skos.Concept"/>
   </ownedComment>
   <name>Concept</name>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-altLabel"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-altLabel"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <name>altLabel</name>
      <type xmi:idref="skos.LanguageString"/>
      <lowerValue xmi:id="skos.Concept-altLabel-lowerValue"
                   xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-altLabel-lowerValue"
                   xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
         <value>0</value>
      </lowerValue>
      <upperValue xmi:id="skos.Concept-altLabel-upperValue"
                   xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-altLabel-upperValue"
                   xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
         <value>*</value>
      </upperValue>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-definition"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-definition"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <name>definition</name>
      <type xmi:idref="skos.LanguageString"/>
      <upperValue xmi:id="skos.Concept-definition-upperValue"
                   xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-definition-upperValue"
                   xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
         <value>*</value>
      </upperValue>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-identifier"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-identifier"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <name>identifier</name>
      <type xmi:idref="skos.XsdAnyUri"/>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-notation"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-notation"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <name>notation</name>
      <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
             href="http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-prefLabel"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-prefLabel"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <name>prefLabel</name>
      <type xmi:idref="skos.LanguageString"/>
      <upperValue xmi:id="skos.Concept-prefLabel-upperValue"
                   xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-prefLabel-upperValue"
                   xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
         <value>*</value>
      </upperValue>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-ownedAttribute-6"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-ownedAttribute-6"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <type xmi:idref="skos.Concept"/>
      <lowerValue xmi:id="skos.Concept-ownedAttribute-6-lowerValue"
                   xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-ownedAttribute-6-lowerValue"
                   xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
         <value>0</value>
      </lowerValue>
      <association xmi:idref="skos.Concept_narrower_Concept"/>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-ownedAttribute-7"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-ownedAttribute-7"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <type xmi:idref="skos.ConceptScheme"/>
      <association xmi:idref="skos.Concept_inScheme_ConceptScheme"/>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-ownedAttribute-8"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-ownedAttribute-8"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <type xmi:idref="skos.ConceptScheme"/>
      <association xmi:idref="skos.Concept_topConceptOf_ConceptScheme"/>
   </ownedAttribute>
   <ownedAttribute xmi:id="skos.Concept-ownedAttribute-9"
                    xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-ownedAttribute-9"
                    xmi:type="uml:Property">
      <type xmi:idref="skos.Concept"/>
      <lowerValue xmi:id="skos.Concept-ownedAttribute-9-lowerValue"
                   xmi:uuid="https://example.org/cdifcodelist#Concept-ownedAttribute-9-lowerValue"
                   xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
         <value>0</value>
      </lowerValue>
      <association xmi:idref="skos.Concept_broader_Concept"/>
   </ownedAttribute>
</packagedElement>
